1143:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_exti.h ****   * @note The configurable wakeup lines are edge-triggered. No glitch must be
1144:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_exti.h ****   *       generated on these lines. If a Falling edge on a configurable interrupt
1145:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_exti.h ****   *       line occurs during a write operation in the EXTI_FTSR register, the
1146:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_exti.h ****   *       pending bit is not set.
1147:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_exti.h ****   *       Rising and falling edge triggers can be set for the same interrupt line.
1148:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_exti.h ****   *       In this case, both generate a trigger condition.
